schedticks=[ 72445 70969 74663 72581 78606 72753 72513 70203 ]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;SCHED 12059ms: gomaxprocs=8 idleprocs=5 threads=11 spinningthreads=2 needspinning=0 idlethreads=6 runqueue=0 [ 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 ] schedticks=[ 77153 76179 79817 78280 85009 77839 78070 75662 ]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;SCHED 13068ms: gomaxprocs=8 idleprocs=7 threads=11 spinningthreads=0 needspinning=0 idlethreads=8 runqueue=0 [ 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 ] schedticks=[ 82339 81916 85356 82984 90854 83077 83607 82227 ]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;SCHED 14079ms: gomaxprocs=8 idleprocs=7 threads=11 spinningthreads=1 needspinning=0 idlethreads=9 runqueue=0 [ 1 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 ] schedticks=[ 87659 87910 91663 88178 95723 89520 88390 88370 ]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;SCHED 15079ms: gomaxprocs=8 idleprocs=7 threads=11 spinningthreads=0 needspinning=0 idlethreads=8 runqueue=0 [ 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 ] schedticks=[ 93030 93990 97924 92899 100948 94961 93246 91989 ]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;SCHED 16080ms: gomaxprocs=8 idleprocs=6 threads=11 spinningthreads=0 needspinning=0 idlethreads=7 runqueue=0 [ 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 ] schedticks=[ 98533 98482 103288 98468 106734 101172 98363 96930 ]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;SCHED 17088ms: gomaxprocs=8 idleprocs=6 threads=11 spinningthreads=1 needspinning=0 idlethreads=8 runqueue=0 [ 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 ] schedticks=[ 104400 103552 108536 104418 112209 105843 103350 101714 ]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;SCHED 28143ms: gomaxprocs=8 idleprocs=5 threads=11 spinningthreads=1 needspinning=0 idlethreads=6 runqueue=0 [ 0 3 0 0 0 1 0 7 ] schedticks=[ 164428 163518 168027 169360 174077 168128 165576 161220 ]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;SCHED 29146ms: gomaxprocs=8 idleprocs=3 threads=11 spinningthreads=1 needspinning=0 idlethreads=5 runqueue=774 [ 231 0 225 239 0 128 0 84 ] schedticks=[ 168307 169130 173004 175091 179723 173093 169846 165721 ]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;cursor: text; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(227, 227, 227); font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Flex&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-align: start; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: rgb(30, 31, 32);&quot;&gt;gomaxprocs=8: The maximum number of goroutines that can run in parallel (simultaneously) on your 8-core CPU.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;cursor: text; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(227, 227, 227); font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Flex&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-align: start; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: rgb(30, 31, 32);&quot;&gt;idleprocs=X: How many of 8 cores are doing nothing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;cursor: text; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(227, 227, 227); font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Flex&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-align: start; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: rgb(30, 31, 32);&quot;&gt;High number: code is waiting/blocked (everyone is sleeping).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;cursor: text; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(227, 227, 227); font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Flex&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-align: start; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: rgb(30, 31, 32);&quot;&gt;Low number (0-1): Your code is working the CPU hard.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;cursor: text; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(227, 227, 227); font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Flex&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-align: start; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: rgb(30, 31, 32);&quot;&gt;threads=11: The OS threads created by the runtime. Usually gomaxprocs + a few for background tasks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;cursor: text; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(227, 227, 227); font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Flex&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-align: start; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: rgb(30, 31, 32);&quot;&gt;spinningthreads=X: Threads looking for work. If this is &amp;gt; 0, Go is actively trying to find a goroutine to run so the CPU doesn&#39;t go idle.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;cursor: text; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; color: rgb(227, 227, 227); font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Flex&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-align: start; white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: rgb(30, 31, 32);&quot;&gt;runqueue=774: The Global Queue. These are the 774 &quot;philosophers&quot; currently standing in the &quot;hallway&quot; waiting for any available core to pick them up.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="-280" y="-1140" width="1280" height="599" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
            </root>
        </mxGraphModel>
